      "text": "CTCAC CA-25-054: Santa Teresa Multifamily, located at 5885 Santa Teresa Boulevard in San Jose, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $2,500,000 in annual federal tax credits and $6,410,282 in total state tax credits to finance the new construction of 48 units of housing serving families and special needs tenants with rents affordable to households earning 30%-50% of area median income (AMI).",
